    "Each vector: call fn(...args) and compare with expect by deep equality (null = no match / valid). findServiceByDomain returns the service id. textFieldIssue returns the ValidationIssue kind or null; text lengths count UTF-16 code units. findAllowDistraction args are (entries, paths[, platform]).",
